{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415762","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415762","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1041576201:1":{"text":"你手上拿着的是……","source_cn":"你手上拿着的是……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF7F340CB8980500B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1041576202:1":{"text":"它的名字叫奇奇！是我的玩偶，也是我最好的朋友！","source_cn":"它的名字叫奇奇！是我的玩偶，也是我最好的朋友！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x596AD28BB967EF6C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041576203:1":{"text":"奇奇很厉害，不仅能陪我玩，还会在遇到坏人的时候保护我！","source_cn":"奇奇很厉害，不仅能陪我玩，还会在遇到坏人的时候保护我！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBD2C8C9843CB11EC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041576204:1":{"text":"其实，我也有一只最喜欢的玩偶……","source_cn":"其实，我也有一只最喜欢的玩偶……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB15C86DD200ED6EE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041576205:1":{"text":"那你一定也给它起了名字！对吧对吧！","source_cn":"那你一定也给它起了名字！对吧对吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA335403B6363CF4E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041576206:1":{"tex